---- MODULE space_reversed__guard_false__view ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == y = 0 /\ x = y
Next == FALSE /\ x' = x /\ y' = y
View == 1
====

